lore mysterious locations, discover new areas, and team up with friends as you try to survive against terrifying monsters. Whether you're running for your life, fighting back, exploring the unknown, or just hanging out with other players, there's always something to do.\n\n\ud83d\udc79 **FIGHT & SURVIVE**\nFace dangerous monsters and do whatever it takes to survive. Work together with your friends or brave the darkness on your own.\n\n\ud83c\udf0e **EXPLORE NEW AREAS**\nDiscover new maps, hidden locations, secrets, and mysterious places waiting to be explored.\n\n\ud83e\udde2 **CUSTOMIZE YOUR CHARACTER**\nCollect and buy unique cosmetics to create your own look and stand out from everyone else.\n\n\ud83d\udc65 **HANG OUT WITH FRIENDS**\nMeet tons of other players, mess around, explore together, and make new friends in a fully multiplayer VR world.\n\n\ud83d\udd26 **THE HORROR NEVER ENDS**\nEvery area has something waiting for you. Stay alert, watch your surroundings, and don't let the monsters catch you.\n\n**Virtual Horror is more than just a horror game \u2014 it's a place to explore, survive, customize, and hang out with friends.**\n\n**Are you ready to enter the Virtual Horror?**\n", "short_description": "**Virtual Horror** is a multiplayer VR horror game where you can explore mysterious areas, fight and escape terrifying monsters, collect and buy cosmetics, and hang out with friends and players from around the world.\n"}]}, "developer_name": "FableWorks Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/virtual-horror/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "FableWorks Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/virtual-horror/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "exte